# This glob matches the file "api/index-all.html" and also the directory "api/p".
# CreateJavadocIndex sorts the matches, so it reads "api/index-all.html" first and then
# fails on "api/p".  The goal file records that the failure is an uncaught exception, and
# that the entries that were read from "api/index-all.html" are discarded rather than
# printed, because CreateJavadocIndex prints nothing until it has read every file.
api/*
